### OCR3 API 테스트 - 계약서 이미지 업로드 및 MongoDB _id 반환 확인

POST http://localhost:8080/api/upload/ocr3
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test-contract.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-contract.txt
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 
# 기대 응답:
# {
#   "contract_data": {
#     "id": "mongodb-generated-id",  // ← 이 부분이 MongoDB _id
#     "contract_type": "월세",
#     "dates": { ... },
#     "property": { ... },
#     "payment": { ... }
#   },
#   "debug_mode": false
# } 